   "notes": [
    "18 swaps: the 15 nonland cards and 3 pain lands with no Marvel printing come out.",
    "What it loses: Colossus Hammer and Argentum Armor (the two best catches) and the Puresteel Paladin and Sram draw engine. Throws top out at five (The Spear of Bashenga) where the open list throws for six.",
    "What replaces them: Helm of the Host copies Cap each combat, and each copy catches an Equipment of its own; The Spear of Bashenga makes you the monarch for cards; Panther Habit turns damage into counters; Masterwork of Ingenuity copies your best Equipment.",
    "Fighter Class is the single copy from the History of Heroes kit, also wanted by Cloud. If Cloud keeps it, run Iconic Shield here.",
    "Prices (Nov 12 snapshot) for the pieces you may not own: Helm of the Host $5.08, Captain America, Unbowed $1.79, Whispersilk Cloak $1.62, Masterwork of Ingenuity $1.50, Panther Habit $1.45, Unstable Molecule Suit $1.20. Several of these are in the Wakanda and Fantastic Four precons you already own.",
    "Not simulated. Expect it about a turn slower than the open list."
